	(text "Listener (observer, never gates the chain). SIG_IN -> C40 100 pF / R35 10k to REFL (159 kHz high-pass) -> R36 10k / C41 22 pF (723 kHz low-pass, light load on the high-pass) -> LST."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 275 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "af0e5c3b-b00a-40ee-bafa-db267a7ddd6b")
	)
	(text "TLV7022 open-drain comparators. Thresholds from the 1M / 33k / 18k ladder (about +-30 mV and +-84 mV for the 47 pF head, plus 3.6 mV of internal hysteresis). For the 100 pF head use 15k and 6.8k. WAKE_N = small window, BIG_N = large window. Pull-ups R24, R42 to +3V3."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 281 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b9117434-6546-44a0-8db8-26001463d704")
	)
