	(text "Power header J7: 1 Onboard + (PMOD 3.3 V), 2 Force +, 3 Sense +, 4 Sense -, 5 Force -. Jumper 1-2 powers the board from the PMOD. For a source-measure unit remove the jumper and connect Force to 2 and 5, Sense to 3 and 4. JP3 (closed) joins the capture rail +3V3_C to +3V3: open it to switch or measure the chain separately. JP1 = head power."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 320 275 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "c68ba3a6-8739-4503-8912-0eb6d73788d5")
	)
